      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA has just launched a summer collection of small leather goods and phone pouches. The small leather goods feature sailboats, whales, and elephants, with vibrant colors and patchwork craftsmanship reminiscent of playful 3D origami—perfect for adding a lively touch when attached to bags. The phone pouches, meanwhile, use bead embroidery on a canvas background to depict starfish and floral motifs, exuding a refreshing summer vibe.",
